WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:04.920
If I concede today in the future how can I govern the state?

00:05.000 --> 00:09.960
Order the city defense forces to hold firm must hold until General Zu Yue arrives.

00:10.040 --> 00:11.240
Yes.

00:18.000 --> 00:38.000
In the twenty-first year of Longwu, Sikong Xu succeeded to the throne as Emperor. Yet owing to his tender age, he could only rely upon the Xie clan, reigning for a few years...

